# Version control and editor
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment files: never bake secrets into images
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Docker and docs
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
README.md
**/*.log
